  "description": "Analog and digital clock views for .NET MAUI — analog, valve (Nixie), flip, melting, sci-fi dematerialise, watch faces, and a multi-timezone world clock (MultiTimeClock) showing local time plus up to three zones, each as a mini clock face with the timezone name above it. Set the additional zones with the ClockTimeZone bindable (e.g. \"Europe/London;America/New_York;Asia/Tokyo\") and the face style with Face.",
